# The experimental gate (ADR 0001). This golden deliberately OMITS the
# `experimental` header line, so the patch loads with allowExperimental=false —
# the default a user gets until they flip "Allow experimental circuits" in the
# module's context menu. The load must fail, and the message must name the
# circuit so it can be found in a long patch.
expect_load_error Circuit 'midihirescc' is experimental
patch <<<
[midihirescc]
    usb       = 1
    hirescc22 = I1
>>>
